<title>HONG KONG: ING's banking arm opens 3rd China branch.</title>
<headline>ING's banking arm opens 3rd China branch.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>ING Bank, the banking arm of the ING Group, said on Thursday it had opened a branch in Xiamen, Fujian province.</p>
<p>The branch is the bank's third in China. The others are in Shanghai and Shenzhen, a spokeswoman for the bank said.</p>
<p>-- HONG KONG NEWSROOM (852) 2843 6369</p>
